<section class="section-cream">
  <div class="wrap section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Jockfall &amp; the Kalix River</span>
    <h2>One of Europe's great salmon rivers, on our doorstep</h2>
    <p>The Kalix river (Kalixälven) is one of Sweden's last major undammed rivers, and Jockfall — its highest waterfall at 9 metres — is renowned among salmon anglers across Europe. It's a short drive from Ballynorsken, and one of the reasons guests come back season after season.</p>
  </div>
