      <p class="media-caption">Jockfall rapids — <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jokkfallet_%C3%B6verkalix_kommun_02_2017-08.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-underline">Wikimedia Commons</a>, CC BY-SA</p>
