<section class="section-forest">
  <div class="wrap section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Hunting at Ballynorsken</span>
    <h2>Moose, capercaillie, and the quiet of the forest</h2>
    <p>Autumn brings the moose hunt — mornings spent in a "jakt torn" hunting tower, or working the forest edge with our Norwegian Elk Hounds. Deeper in the pine forest, the capercaillie (tjäder) — Europe's largest grouse, and a striking bird nearly a metre long — offers a quieter, more traditional style of bird hunting, best experienced at dawn with a local guide who knows the leks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap grid-auto-fit-xl">
